{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25109","headline":"对镜吟 · 长孙佐辅","name":"对镜吟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"忆昔逢君新纳娉，青铜铸出千年镜。\n意怜光彩固无瑕，义比恩情永相映。\n每将鉴面兼鉴心，鉴来不辍情逾深。\n君非结心空结带，结处尚新恩已背。\n开帘览镜悲难语，对面相看孟门阻。\n掩匣徒慙双凤飞，悬台欲效孤鸾舞。\n昔日照来人共许，今朝照罢自生疑。\n镜上有尘犹可淬，君恩讵肯无回时。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"长孙佐辅","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25109.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25109","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}